#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:27
#: 70092f36110b40d78fbc027200dbddb2
msgid "You can display video from your aircraft on the Mission Planner's HUD if you are digitizing it with the same laptop (with a video capture card or USB device). Just select the device in the Configuration/Planner screen, chose video format and press \"Start\" to begin recording. If you select the HUD checkbox, the video display will replace the artificial horizon in the HUD."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:33
#: 6d8a5ff70597454a9f5be7fd7f25aa47
msgid "You can also record the video that you're displaying to an AVI file. Just right-click in the HUD and choose from the menu that will pop up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:36
#: 0c408f42ec6d48fa948f772dbb38b3f4
msgid "You can send NMEA (GPS) output to the serial port. Press control-g and you will get a box asking for a comport and baud rate to output standard NMEA data at 2 Hz, to any serial port. One application would be to use com2com to emulate a serial port to use with third party applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:41
#: f21ccfae4d53436aaec67c9a0c820822
msgid "You can have the Mission Planner load non-standard firmware (any .hex files that you've made or got elsewhere) to APM by pressing Control-C on the firmware loading screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:44
#: f7e784562c1049ada607fa2358894f9d
msgid "Mission Planner can give you audio speech alerts for events that you choose, such as hitting waypoints or low battery. Just go to **Configuration \\| Planner \\| Speech \\| Enable Speech**"
msgstr ""

